<title>ROMANIA: Romanian producer prices 5.2 pct up in April.</title>
<headline>Romanian producer prices 5.2 pct up in April.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose by 5.2 percent in April after a 52.6 percent growth in March when fuel, energy and food prices were freed, National Statistics Board (CNS) data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Producer prices were 189.6 percent up year on year in</p>
<p>April.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES    APRIL 97  MARCH 97   APRIL 96</p>
<p> mth/mth change		    +5.2	+52.6	+4.1</p>
<p>  extraction industry	    +2.2     +198.9     +12.6</p>
<p>  processing industry	    +6.3	+32.5	+3.8</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	+1.9     +160.2	+0.1</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
